        "notes": "H.A.D.E.S ZERO includes depictions of graphic violence, including biological horror, grotesque creatures, and body horror. It explores dark themes such as psychological trauma, genetic manipulation, and institutional abuse. The game features moments of physical and emotional deterioration, as well as disturbing philosophical and religious references. It does not contain explicit sexual content or sexual innuendo, but addresses themes of despair, guilt, and the struggle for survival in a hostile environment. Discretion is advised for players sensitive to these themes."
